        "comments": "This diploid assembly contains pseudo-haplotypes from the Trypanosoma cruzi CL strain. The genome assembly was created using the T. cruzi CL Brener assembly from TriTrypDB v.24 as a reference. Reads were mapped to the entire T. cruzi CL Brener genome with BWA, and reads aligning to each haplotype were extracted for use in individual haplotype assembly runs (run performed in Newbler, with no reference assembly provided during assembly process). Contigs <500 bp in length were removed from the final assemblies. The primary haplotype sequences (Esmeraldo-like) are MKQG01000001-MKQG01002387. The alternative haplotype sequences (non-Esmeraldo-like) are MKQG01002388-MKQG01004677. Sequences that were unable to be distinguished between the haplotypes are MKQG01004678-MKQG01007764.",
